{"time": 1763527563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1975883936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦？”舒蕾抬了抬眉毛“你……你们希望我做什么去？”"}
{"time": 1763527617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "378549524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“阿姨想...做什么就做什么...”有点没底气"}
