{"time": 1763623963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "732064051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=AAF0844FB0EE8B2E6FF8E8FA15DAC427.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRKz40Q4egErq_MBnnQrQVJ9q4qvRi-pQsg_woo38HFnpuAkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQV3BqG-jVTbpsbieE_N28pnoCltWCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMH-4W-T4zIAk5yw1gKLVW7XXl1sLU5T5N2TM8tHaYcBV28NnoLDgdtQA-BzV0e_BkQ,file_size=185022]"}
{"time": 1763624017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1609731595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(奶萝纯黑啊)"}
{"time": 1763624023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62265826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(偏爱)"}
{"time": 1763624063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1921686512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1274765275]推开门，\"抱歉这个时候还来打扰姐姐...之前说的事...\""}
{"time": 1763624660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687910955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "门内，莫辛窝在甘纳许的怀里，闭着眼，看起来像睡着了。甘纳许则坐在床上朝门口看过来，看起来身体状态比精神状态略逊一筹。"}
{"time": 1763624747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "85788329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "似乎来的不是时候，在舒茉耳边小声说道“莫辛姐姐在睡觉，要不别打扰她了吧”"}
{"time": 1763624781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "548989335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不打扰”她的声音和本人一样干巴，不过还算有生气“怎么了？”"}
{"time": 1763624829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "537913253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊...\"看着她们的样子，立刻噤声，刚刚捂住嘴巴，又听见她的话，松了口气，\"早上舒茉来问过阿姨和姐姐，要不要跟我们一起去西海岸。\""}
{"time": 1763625182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2087577197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“迈尔斯先生也来问过了”她顿了顿“去哪都比这里好些，这里只要有墓就好了”"}
{"time": 1763625336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "599487404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"点点头，\"还有...让两位想起那些记忆...是我的私心...如果做错了...我向两位道歉...\"低下脑袋等待对方的指责也好"}
{"time": 1763625487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1003686453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……什么？”她看起来有些状况外"}
{"time": 1763625609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1504897510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...莫辛姐姐说她把爸爸忘了...我让她想起了那些...\""}
{"time": 1763626111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972897997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……算了，没事。我没忘也不会忘……莫辛……至少哭出来了”甘纳许靠在床头“……我一开始其实没有报什么期望”"}
{"time": 1763626186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587456188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“就算只是一个结果也好...我是这么想的。”"}
{"time": 1763626195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558063495", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯”"}
{"time": 1763626293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1212729423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在一旁呆呆的站着，不知道该说些什么，结果其实到最后也没有找到真正的凶手，安慰的话完全讲不出来......."}
{"time": 1763626737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "930480420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像理解错了）"}
{"time": 1763626905, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011341053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……我不知道魔法协会长什么样，但我觉得肯定不是你们这样”她顿了顿“我们需要的也不是那样的东西。谢谢。”"}
{"time": 1763626990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1857533040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...阿姨的意思是，不和我们一起吗？”对这个结果也算在意料之中，毕竟关于别人的选择，不是自己可以强求的结果。"}
{"time": 1763627019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "131447515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我觉得在误解的道路上一路狂飙了）"}
{"time": 1763627129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830813505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她的意思是从来没相信过你们是魔法协会的，但是不在意你们的身份）"}
{"time": 1763627138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "55351390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1763627194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "845621792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（毕竟你们确实把事情做完了）"}
{"time": 1763627255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834686474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们确实不是协会的人...抱歉”"}
{"time": 1763627389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438974072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...骗了阿姨和姐姐...对不起。”微微弯腰，“如果两位不愿意和我们同行，舒茉也理解...”"}
{"time": 1763627395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "843486295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（那误解都误解了）"}
{"time": 1763627944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343982122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“为什么会这么想？我是说……我们这样子，即便有保险，也很难说得上能‘同行’”甘纳许低头摸了摸熟睡的莫辛的脑袋"}
{"time": 1763628086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1873466744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看了看伊恩，自己曾一度想要放弃，好在...\"嗯...遇见了就不能坐视不理，只是这样...不过这么说应该很难相信吧...\""}
{"time": 1763628549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1827692268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“别这样，还是开个报价……是不是应该和你们的家长说这个才对？”"}
{"time": 1763628794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "219287186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...报价？”有些不太理解她为什么在这个时候说这个，“啊...”"}
{"time": 1763628875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711252686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这个还是和舒蕾阿姨聊吧....”"}
{"time": 1763629051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1907153585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我就直接说了”她闭上眼，看起来有些不安“现在这个样子，我们还没办法自己照顾自己。不管要去哪，在生活走上正轨之前都得有一大笔开销。只靠我们自己，或者雇佣别的什么人……我不确定够不够用”"}
{"time": 1763629128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2007753098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"等她继续说下去，不插话"}
{"time": 1763629411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1519719397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“同行的话，路上一定会麻烦你们……我想你们应该做好了这样的心理准备才会那么说吧，但是没有报酬，这样能维持多久呢？我不该透支你们的好意……但我怕我也无力负担更多。”"}
{"time": 1763629469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114227496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想说点什么，但应该轮不到自己来表态，毕竟自己现在的处境其实和她们母女两差不多"}
{"time": 1763629535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1204159138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“所以……我恳求几位，在我们找到活路之前，能不能……接受低一点的报价？或者记在账上也可以……”"}
{"time": 1763629667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075145641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "轻轻点头，心里带着认可和佩服，\"舒茉觉得妈妈也会答应的。\"不过这么说，对方似乎是愿意和我们同行了，走上前靠近一些，\"阿姨和姐姐伤到哪了？\"转移掉这个话题"}
{"time": 1763629942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "368555853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么突然问这个？”她睁开眼睛，不过还是回答了你“皮肤，呼吸道。她的一边耳朵，我的两根脚趾，还有……”她压低声音，指了指自己被绷带包住的那只眼睛“视力下降得很厉害……我还没告诉别人”"}
{"time": 1763630044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549024798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...如果是外伤的话，之后找一找牧师的话，应该有办法治愈。\"点点头，\"阿姨不用担心，这件事舒茉会去想办法...\"松了口气，只要心理不出事就好，当然这句话没说"}
{"time": 1763630063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2130130974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（谁知道呢）"}
{"time": 1763630073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "551145299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（转双相了）"}
{"time": 1763630117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876906822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=8FEDAA8C256CB0DDFD8ABD2169844504.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQ-womQrrxFrO09wAUod5Lt2Nbt3xi5pQ8g_woo0oy6lLKAkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQd9lvQXf1Oyw8TKBYmUsxQ3oCAjGCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMFWEeqiFXF0EYfSDs6TKJU5jOFqxGe7LqwY3EOIlsVDVKWLVN0e65QTdqHDS6xEiJQ,file_size=250553]"}
